1
00:00:27,480 --> 00:00:28,160
Hey, buddy!

2
00:00:30,640 --> 00:00:31,400
Are you okay?

3
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:32,720
Buddy!

4
00:00:34,680 --> 00:00:35,520
Buddy!

5
00:00:35,520 --> 00:00:39,180
=Dear Song=

6
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:40,280
Buddy!

7
00:00:42,460 --> 00:00:44,580
=Episode 22=
(Getting What She Wants)

8
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:03,840
Pingjiang.

9
00:01:03,960 --> 00:01:04,360
(Zhexiang Fishing)
Hey.

10
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:06,600
I don't know how to thank you
for saving my life.

11
00:01:07,440 --> 00:01:09,160
Well, you go out to sea every day.

12
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:11,120
Let me help you out.

13
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:11,920
Sure.

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:12,680
Come on.

15
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:14,520
Let me tell you something.

16
00:01:15,200 --> 00:01:15,800
Look.

17
00:01:16,040 --> 00:01:19,040
That stretch of water over there
is where the warm currents meet.

18
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:22,240
There's a rare kind of silver seabream
that spawns there.

19
00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:23,800
I just found it.

20
00:01:24,520 --> 00:01:25,760
Do you know how much

21
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:28,640
restaurants in the city charge per kg
for this fish?

22
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:31,120
This much!

23
00:01:38,440 --> 00:01:39,320
Pingjiang.

24
00:01:39,720 --> 00:01:41,320
This is a huge find!

25
00:01:41,920 --> 00:01:43,320
Can you take me to see it?

26
00:01:43,920 --> 00:01:44,960
Sure, sure!

27
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,320
Come on.

28
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:48,120
Give me a hand.

29
00:01:50,960 --> 00:01:51,680
Over there.

30
00:01:55,320 --> 00:01:57,200
(Dad never lets me help out at sea.)

31
00:01:57,320 --> 00:01:58,720
(I secretly followed him here today.)

32
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,240
(I'll definitely surprise him.)

33
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:08,120
♪The crescent moon; the birds all sing♪

34
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:11,440
♪Papa sails out to fish♪

35
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:16,000
♪The crescent moon; the birds all sing♪

36
00:02:16,000 --> 00:02:19,320
♪Papa sails out to fish♪

37
00:03:01,440 --> 00:03:03,040
You little brat.

38
00:03:03,040 --> 00:03:04,360
So you're hiding here!

39
00:03:15,080 --> 00:03:16,680
Dad!

40
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:20,600
Dad!

41
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,600
I'm here.

42
00:03:34,440 --> 00:03:36,240
- Dad.
- I'm here.

43
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,880
It's alright.

44
00:03:42,000 --> 00:03:42,680
Dad.

45
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,280
I...

46
00:03:45,880 --> 00:03:46,680
It's okay.

47
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:03,240
Dad.

48
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,160
Dad!

49
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,560
Dad.

50
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:18,080
Dad, don't go.

51
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:24,040
Dad.

52
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:29,560
Later,

53
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:32,200
the fishing operation grew
into a fishing company.

54
00:04:32,760 --> 00:04:35,520
Song Huaishan made his first fortune.

55
00:04:36,360 --> 00:04:38,400
Then it expanded into hotels.

56
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,000
Then it moved into real estate.

57
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,160
He cleaned up his image

58
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:46,920
and became Mr. Song,
respected throughout Nigang.

59
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:48,920
But half of every penny he made

60
00:04:50,720 --> 00:04:52,760
was stained with my father's blood.

61
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,200
I understand why you hate him,

62
00:04:57,720 --> 00:05:00,000
but Song Group has to come back to me.

63
00:05:01,800 --> 00:05:03,840
My mother paid for it with her life.

64
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:06,360
And it's my grandfather's life's work.

65
00:05:06,960 --> 00:05:10,840
I'll make Song Huaishan,
Song Huan, Song Lin,

66
00:05:10,920 --> 00:05:13,720
and everyone who wronged my family
kneel in front of me

67
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:14,640
and apologize!

68
00:05:15,120 --> 00:05:16,320
But only if

69
00:05:16,920 --> 00:05:19,840
Song Group comes back to me clean.

70
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:21,920
Yu Song,

71
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,760
Song Group must stay in Song hands.

72
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:26,360
Song, as in Song Cheng.

73
00:05:27,320 --> 00:05:27,960
Song Cheng,

74
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,920
Song Group will never be clean!

75
00:05:30,000 --> 00:05:33,120
Ever since Song Huaishan killed my dad
and took what was his,

76
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:34,760
it's been rotten to the core!

77
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,360
I don't want to hear this!

78
00:05:40,960 --> 00:05:41,760
Yu Song.

79
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:45,000
You promised me.

80
00:05:51,400 --> 00:05:54,120
Do you really have to destroy
the thing I care about most?

81
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:59,720
Is there really no third option for us?

82
00:05:59,720 --> 00:06:01,520
There's no third option!

83
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:04,740
♪All my thoughts freeze in place♪

84
00:06:05,180 --> 00:06:10,260
♪My aching nerves start to twitch♪

85
00:06:10,500 --> 00:06:15,100
♪Will love break when it ends?♪

86
00:06:15,380 --> 00:06:20,100
♪Who leaves whom behind in the past?♪

87
00:06:20,500 --> 00:06:25,180
♪Who will play the heartless one?♪

88
00:06:25,300 --> 00:06:30,400
♪The one who leaves
isn't the one to pity♪

89
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:30,920
Okay.

90
00:06:33,360 --> 00:06:34,160
I understand.

91
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:38,680
Here. Take it back.

92
00:06:40,220 --> 00:06:42,420
♪Half longing♪

93
00:06:42,580 --> 00:06:44,860
♪Half resentment♪
(Song)

94
00:06:45,420 --> 00:06:50,100
♪Love spreads through the eyes♪

95
00:06:50,220 --> 00:06:52,620
♪It shapes infinity♪

96
00:06:52,780 --> 00:06:55,460
♪A circle turning endlessly♪

97
00:06:55,540 --> 00:07:00,060
♪In whose heart are the lies spreading?♪

98
00:07:00,260 --> 00:07:02,460
♪Half is a promise♪

99
00:07:02,700 --> 00:07:05,140
♪Half rotting away♪

100
00:07:05,300 --> 00:07:09,860
♪If love always hides something♪

101
00:07:10,260 --> 00:07:13,020
♪Then her tears♪

102
00:07:13,140 --> 00:07:16,420
♪Fade away♪

103
00:07:23,540 --> 00:07:24,920
(Song)

104
00:07:24,920 --> 00:07:25,760
Ms. Yu,

105
00:07:26,240 --> 00:07:27,320
I'm curious

106
00:07:28,080 --> 00:07:29,920
why you carved your name into it.

107
00:07:31,400 --> 00:07:33,240
Exchanging names is basic courtesy.

108
00:07:34,320 --> 00:07:36,040
I know your name already,

109
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,720
but I never got the chance

110
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:39,120
to introduce myself.

111
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,720
If I fail this interview,

112
00:07:41,960 --> 00:07:43,520
consider it my way of saying hello.

113
00:07:43,520 --> 00:07:47,220
♪But love keeps her from moving on♪
(Song)

114
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:52,460
♪She can't let go, caught in between♪

115
00:07:52,620 --> 00:07:57,460
♪Love and longing, each half remains♪

116
00:07:57,660 --> 00:08:02,260
♪In whose heart are the lies spreading?♪

117
00:08:02,380 --> 00:08:04,620
♪Half is a promise♪

118
00:08:04,700 --> 00:08:07,220
♪Half rotting away♪

119
00:08:07,420 --> 00:08:11,980
♪If love always hides something♪

120
00:08:12,260 --> 00:08:14,980
♪Then her tears♪
(Song Lin's Resume: Bio & Family)

121
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:18,420
♪Fade away♪
(Song)

122
00:08:25,780 --> 00:08:28,460
(Song Lin's Resume:
Bio/Family Background)

123
00:08:46,040 --> 00:08:47,080
I never thought

124
00:08:47,600 --> 00:08:49,000
the one who'd hidden herself best
in the Song family

125
00:08:49,480 --> 00:08:50,320
was Song Cheng.

126
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:55,600
Song.

127
00:08:56,720 --> 00:08:58,160
Do you two really have to fight
over this position?

128
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,120
Why don't we leave Nigang?

129
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:06,440
We have enough money.

130
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,720
We can totally start over.

131
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:11,960
Jing.

132
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,120
Look into something for me.
